# ==============================================================================
# FILE HEADER: Git Ignore Rules — GCP Antigravity Client VM Provisioning
# ==============================================================================
# Author: Pradeep Singh
# License: Apache-2.0
#
# Purpose:
#   Prevents local environment overrides, RDP connection profiles, SSH keys,
#   service account credentials, and editor/OS noise from entering git history.
#
# Architecture / Context:
#   Applies to `New/vm-provisioning/` and all nested subdirectories (`common/`,
#   `linux/`, `windows/`).
#
# Dependencies / Side Effects:
#   Explicitly un-ignores `.env.example` and `settings.env`.
# ==============================================================================

# Secrets, Credentials & Local Overrides
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.ppk
*.rdp
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
gcloud-key.json

# Temporary Startup / Diagnostic Artifacts
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

# Operating System & IDE Noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
